cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RAC-Hide in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "RAC-Hide: robust DCT-domain image steganography"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free implementation of robust image steganography that embeds a
  JPEG secret into the relationships between low-frequency DCT coefficients of a
  cover image. The payload survives lossy JPEG/WebP re-compression and
  proportional rescaling, and is recovered blindly without the original cover.
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/OWNER/rac-hide"
keywords:
  - steganography
  - information hiding
  - digital watermarking
  - discrete cosine transform
  - Reed-Solomon
  - robust coding
authors:
  - name: "RAC-Hide contributors"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-17"
